@Mehewara.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5194

### 1. Health Check / Weather
GET {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Register / Sign Up a New Resident (No profile picture required at signup)
# @name register
POST {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Kasun",
  "lastName": "Perera",
  "email": "kasun.perera@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phoneNumber": "+94771234567"
}

###

### 3. Sign In as Resident (Get Resident JWT Token)
# @name residentLogin
POST {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kasun.perera@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### 4. Sign In as Coordinator / Admin (Get Admin JWT Token)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mehewara.gov.lk",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### Extract Tokens from login responses
@residentToken = {{residentLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

###

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Requires Bearer Token)
GET {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Update Profile Text Info (PATCH name / phone number)
PATCH {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Kasun",
  "lastName": "Perera",
  "phoneNumber": "+94719876543"
}

###

### 7. Upload User Profile Photo to Cloudinary (PATCH multipart/form-data)
PATCH {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-avatar.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 8. Remove User Profile Photo (DELETE)
DELETE {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}

###

### ============================================================
### MEMBER 1: REPORT & INTAKE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### 9. Upload Report Photo to Cloudinary (Resident / Admin)
# @name uploadReportPhoto
POST {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="flooded_road.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-report-photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 10. Submit a New Municipal Report (Role: RESIDENT)
# @name createReport
POST {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Heavy storm water overflowing and covering the road near Central College. Vehicles cannot pass safely.",
  "category": "DRAINAGE",
  "latitude": 6.9271,
  "longitude": 79.8612,
  "address": "Central College area, Colombo 10",
  "photos": [
    {
      "photoUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg",
      "fileName": "flooded_road.jpg",
      "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Extract Report ID from create report response
@createdReportId = {{createReport.response.body.id}}

###

### 11. Coordinator Report List with Filters & Pagination (Role: ADMIN)
GET {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports?page=1&pageSize=10&status=PENDING&category=DRAINAGE&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Coordinator Report List - Search by Text (Role: ADMIN)
GET {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports?search=College&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Get Report Details by ID (Role: ADMIN or Owning RESIDENT)
GET {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/{{createdReportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. Resident "My Reports" List (Role: RESIDENT)
GET {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/resident/reports?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{residentToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 15. Google OAuth Login
POST {{Mehewara.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "YOUR_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
}
